WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
Tsukikage kooru daichi wo

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
Korogari fumiwakete yuku

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
Horobi to saisei no jidai ga hajimaru

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Jiyuu wo omoku kakagete

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Michinaki michi wo erande

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Mahiru yori mabushii nichibotsu wo koete

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
Yume wo kataru you ni toki no fune wa yuku

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
Sono yamiji no mukou ni atarashii yoake

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
Bokura wa kitto kurayami no kaina kara umarete kita

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Kanawanu koi wo suruyou ni

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
Hikari e to samayotteku

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
Doko made mo hateshino nai kono michi wo

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
Kaeru sube wa nai

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.130
Who's behind all this?

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.480
Who sent you?

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.040
There's no way out. Just tell us.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:02.280
It's a bomb!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.410
Hmph.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.640
Not bad.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.520
He literally disappeared into the smoke!

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:36.220
Leader!

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.380
Guys!

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.630
Thank you for saving us from danger.

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:48.030
Akizuki-sama, if you hadn't
come back, we would've...

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.700
I didn't come back to save you.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.830
What? The leader was just trying to be...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.230
So what brought you back here then?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:03.050
Come on. You two need to thank him, too.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.910
Thank you!

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:34.240
There are two sides to everything.
Politics are no different.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.880
You do understand that, right?

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.480
Of course I do!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:43.660
If there's any traitor you wish to dispose of,

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:46.920
I can certainly take care of that for you
since you can't do so publicly.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:50.330
We have skilled men to do the job!

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.900
We are those who become Akki Rasetsu,

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:57.490
in order to slay all who threaten
the peace of the land!

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:00.010
I am the first Rasetsu!

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:02.770
The one who wields the
Earth-Splitting Sword,

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:04.440
Genba Hario!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.570
I am the second Rasetsu!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.720
The one who strikes through
the eye of a needle from far away!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.110
They're stiff.
The one who strikes through
the eye of a needle from far away!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:17.860
I understand this is the first day of practice,
but they'll need a lot more of it.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:24.730
Akki Rasetsu's rear guard, the praying mantis
with the double-edge blade, Dakkatsu Kumou!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:28.530
So, have you decided?

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.620
To strike it down...

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.900
To strike down the Head.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.650
The sea is nice!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.580
There's a whole world beyond the sea!

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:57.250
Oh? So you came here to kill me?

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.850
You've got the same eyes.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.230
The eyes I had before when I
went to kill Katsu-sensei.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:09.610
Why don't you become my bodyguard, Akizuki?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.520
Akizuki-sama, I'm troubled.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.530
Just like...

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.700
Just like Sakamoto-sensei,

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:35.360
who died while trying to bring about
a better future for this country.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:42.900
Why tell me things like that?

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:08.190
Mr. Saiga, it was not like you to miss a shot.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.470
I can't believe you failed to shoot that little girl.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.330
Maybe, but I still believe in you.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:25.920
I believe in the skill of Magozo Saiga,
a distant descendant of the Saiga clan,

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:31.550
who made Nobunaga Oda suffer
with its invincible rifle team.

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:35.920
Besides, the curtain of the play has just opened.

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:42.330
This is the item you've requested.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.470
I will get the target for sure...

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:26.670
What's the matter?

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.610
What about the play?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.050
Here!

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:33.950
<i>TO</i>
<i>YOJIRO AKIZUKI</i>

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.600
The unsavory ties...

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:55.200
Cannot be cut easily...

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:02.870
You pretend they're cut...

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:07.250
But eventually...

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:17.290
They'll be connected again in shadow...

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:23.490
Hey, I love it, I love it! You're the best, Tayu!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:27.130
Well, thank you so much.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.040
There he is.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.240
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.420
Forgive my long absence.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:49.390
Oh well, I could say the same.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:53.820
Hey, what are you doing, Tayu? Sake, sake!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.270
Yes!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:58.700
Thank you for coming.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:07.710
Three months... I guess it's been
longer than that, huh?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:11.910
Why didn't you mention my name back then?

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:18.820
If you did, you could've been free and done
with the interrogation much sooner.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:20.790
It is already over.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:24.790
Are you sure? It is really over?

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.430
OUMIYA
INN

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:57.920
So what brought you to Yokohama?
Are you here to watch the play?

00:10:58.500 --> 00:10:59.830
What about you, Katsu-sensei?

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:05.160
Me? I always end up drawing
the shortest of short straws.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:17.320
When I make the right one stand,
the left one falls...

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:26.660
When I make both stand, I fall

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:31.860
Well, things seem like they're
going to work out with the British.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:35.730
All that's left is to meet with
the Imperial Army's resident genius,

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:39.530
and watch the cherry blossoms at Mt. Atago.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:45.010
At any rate, the earthquake couldn't have
happened at a worse time...

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.780
Well, maybe it was for the best.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:17.710
If you were a warrior, I would give you
the mercy of committing seppuku,

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:22.340
but you're nothing but a merchant,
who cares only about money.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:26.050
This is the best way for you to die.

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:28.290
If you must hate, if you must despise,

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:35.990
then hate yourself, despise yourself for
daring to oppose the Director of Palace Upkeep!

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:12.300
They're pretty business-savvy
for mere actors, aren't they?

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:16.100
Director of Palace Upkeep li is already gone.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:21.960
But allowing them to go any further
would cause me some serious trouble.

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:28.080
Now I'm going to make them regret they
hadn't kept the play as a simple play for fun!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.620
Wow, check out the crowd!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:43.220
I want to go see it before I die.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.460
I hear they're going to reveal the bad guys
connected to the Director of Palace Upkeep.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:49.300
How scary! That's pretty serious.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:49.390
SOLD OUT

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:03.850
It's been three days since opening day.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:08.110
The more popular it becomes, the more likely
the enemy makes its move. I'm sure of it.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:13.190
I'm the one who wrote it, but you're the one
who performs on stage for them to see.

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:16.990
Whether you keep going or close the curtain...

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.460
That's your decision.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.130
We're ready to face the consequences, Master.
Since that day ten years ago...

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:34.170
I'm still new to this, but
it's too late to turn back now.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:34.970
Right.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:40.050
All right, but once you open the curtain,
you can't cancel the play.

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:43.890
What's more, 80% of the weapons
that the enemy uses are guns.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:46.050
We're aware of that, too.

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:52.020
Akizuki-sama, we entrust our lives with you.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:06.800
Welcome, welcome!
We're the Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe!

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.470
Excuse me from the stage!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:17.720
It's the middle day of our performance schedule,
and I'd like to say something to you!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:21.580
There are two sides to everything!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.660
This is our new play,

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.900
"The reverse side of a bribery scandal!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.130
The Hidden Secret of the
Director of Palace Upkeep"

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:36.730
Because of your support, it's been sold out
since opening day, and we'd like to thank you!

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:45.940
The play will start momentarily!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:50.820
We hope everyone enjoy the play
until the very end!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:59.460
Your support is very much appreciated!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.540
This is exactly how you should die!

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:11.140
If you must hate, if you must despise,

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:21.450
then hate yourself, despise yourself for daring to
oppose the Director of Palace Upkeep!

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:28.390
A thousand mornings and
a thousand nights pass:

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.550
The sky stretches forever
for travelers!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.560
A thousand mornings and
a thousand nights pass:

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:37.430
The flower of revenge never dies!

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:41.240
A thousand mornings and
a thousand nights pass:

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:44.500
I know neither love nor tomorrow.

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.700
I found myself on stage once again tonight.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:06.190
Revenge? That's ridiculous.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:10.900
I'm sorry to tell you this, but I don't remember
seeing any of you before.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.360
What?

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:17.770
Hearing nonsense from you
just reminded me of your stupid face.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.310
After sinking so low, you still perform
a silly play like this? You make me laugh!

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:23.510
What did you say?

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:27.980
Who is it? Who made you kill
my father and mother?

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:30.760
If you want to know, I'll tell you.

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:37.590
Before you stain my Earth-Splitting Sword
and perform your stupid play from your grave!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.730
The person is!

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:44.600
Who is it?

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.040
Who sent you?

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.340
Answer me!

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:00.610
The name! Give me the name!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.790
The name is...

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.860
What is the name?

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:08.780
What is the name?

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.920
Are you okay?

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.890
Yeah, it's just a scratch.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:41.160
More importantly, you need to hurry up...

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.220
Sorry...

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.650
Traitors!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.770
You're going to stain our blades!

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:05.710
Kill them!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.970
Police! Police!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:34.860
POLICE

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:29.110
Police! Police!

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:32.980
Quiet! This is the Kanagawa Magistrate's Office!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.840
Arrest every one of them!

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:53.290
Move! Move! Move!

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.790
I am the second Akki Rasetsu!

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.300
Descendant of the Saiga Clan,
the most powerful rifle team of all!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.470
I'm Magozo Saiga!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.500
I'm going to put an end to this play!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:11.140
Eat my bullets!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:29.300
Wow, bravo!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.870
What?

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>ANECDOTE OF AN</i>
<i>UNDERHANDED SCANDAL</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
Sono te wa ai no tsurugi

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Hikaru sora no hate

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
Yume wa mada maboroshi

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
Chigireta ai no tsurugi

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
Sashidasu saki wa ikusen no namida ga hitotsu ni nari

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
Ashita wo kagayakaseru

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
Kono te wa ai no tsurugi

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:48.400
EPISODE 5
SHUREIKI
UNLEASHED

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:34.450
Kill!

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:35.390
Kill!
Kill!

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:36.450
Kill!

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:38.190
I am the third Akki Rasetsu!

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:42.590
the one who wields the Karasuma-Style
fighting armor, Kurota Karasuma!

00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:44.600
I am the fourth Akki Rasetsu,

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:47.660
the one who wields
the Chinese broadsword, Kaen Ryu!

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:48.400
I am the fifth Akki Rasetsu,

00:23:48.400 --> 00:24:02.540
SHUREIKI
UNLEASHED

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:49.400
I am the fifth Akki Rasetsu,

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:53.070
the one who wields the two swords,
Gezai Hachisuka!

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:58.080
We become Shureiki, to protect the darkness!

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:01.710
Kill! Kill! Kill!
